  <!-- Vanilla's own effect arrow becomes craftable on the same terms as the six above, so that one
       rule covers every effect arrow in the game. One per craft, at a grenade's bit cost: finding
       a stack of 1d4 in the wild still beats making them, which is how Qud gates them today. -->

